# Code owners for onfire-mcp-skills.
#
# With "Require review from Code Owners" enabled on main, every PR needs an
# approving review from a code owner listed below. Approval authority is
# intentionally limited to @NitzanOnFire and @GalOnFire — no other approval
# (including from the wider developers team) can satisfy the requirement.
#
# Extra emphasis is documented on the executable + instruction surface — the
# parts an installer's agent will trust and run: SKILL.md instructions, the
# plugin manifest, and any hooks, MCP servers, or bundled scripts.

# Default: all changes require approval from Nitzan or Gal.
*                       @NitzanOnFire @GalOnFire

# Instruction surface (natural-language directives the agent follows).
/skills/                @NitzanOnFire @GalOnFire

# Plugin manifest / marketplace (declares components, hooks, MCP, allowed-tools).
/.claude-plugin/        @NitzanOnFire @GalOnFire

# Auto-executing / code-execution surface — review with extra care.
**/hooks.json           @NitzanOnFire @GalOnFire
.mcp.json               @NitzanOnFire @GalOnFire
**/*.mcp.json           @NitzanOnFire @GalOnFire
**/scripts/             @NitzanOnFire @GalOnFire
*.sh                    @NitzanOnFire @GalOnFire
*.py                    @NitzanOnFire @GalOnFire

# Security tooling itself.
/.gitleaks.toml         @NitzanOnFire @GalOnFire
/.pre-commit-config.yaml @NitzanOnFire @GalOnFire
